@@ -1333,6 +1333,12 @@ Hash types available depend on the control system running Ansible, 'hash' depend
 Some hash types allow providing a rounds parameter::
 
     {{ 'secretpassword' | password_hash('sha256', 'mysecretsalt', rounds=10000) }}
+
+For BCrypt, use ``ident`` to select the hash variant. Supported values are
+``2``, ``2a``, ``2y``, and ``2b``. The selected variant must be supported by
+the hashing library on the control system::
+
+    {{ 'secretpassword' | password_hash('blowfish', ident='2a') }}
     # => "$5$rounds=10000$mysecretsalt$Tkm80llAxD4YHll6AgNIztKn0vzAACsuuEfYeGP7tm7"
 
 .. _other_useful_filters:
